From: Oliver Solomon <47696354+OliverSolomon@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 27 Nov 2026 08:36:11 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/6] Embedding hooks: host-kept saves and AutoSave, hideable
 title bar, ribbon and status bar

An Embed struct on WordApp holds what a page hosting WordCraft turns off or
takes over, apart from the saved preferences. The shell hides the title
bar, ribbon and status bar slots by it, the File page goes when the host
hides its tab, and AutoSave may run through a host that keeps documents.
